    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**EMAIL ENQUIRIES ONLY / NO PHONE CALLS**\r\n\r\nDoran Estates presenting No. 163 Adelaide Square - A truly exceptional two-bedroom penthouse apartment. This elegant property boasts spacious bedrooms with generous storage, accentuated by stunning French oak floorboards throughout. No. 163 stands out with its generously sized and brilliantly lit open-plan living and dining area that seamlessly flows into a well-appointed kitchen. The kitchen itself is a testament to quality, featuring top-tier wall and floor ceramic tiling along with state-of-the-art Neff kitchen appliances. Furthermore, this penthouse offers the luxury of a spacious balcony, perfect for outdoor relaxation.\r\n\r\nAdelaide Square - Where Elegance Meets Urban Living Nestled in the heart of Dublin, Adelaide Square is a modern complex comprising 176 luxurious apartments and penthouses. The complex offers residents a plethora of amenities, including a 24-hour Concierge Service, a Fitness Centre, Swimming pool, a laundry room. The main entrance's fully glazed frontage welcomes you into a light-filled reception area adorned with occasional seating and exquisite feature lighting, exuding an unmistakable sense of luxury. Elegant stone and hardwood wall finishes complete the ambiance. The development prioritizes security with a 24-hour concierge service and CCTV surveillance. Lifts to each floor and individual post boxes are conveniently located here. 'On-Site Facilities & Leisure Centre' At ground level, a central courtyard featuring a soothing water feature is thoughtfully landscaped to offer various seating areas within a tranquil garden setting. Adelaide Square also boasts a fitness and leisure center exclusive to its residents, featuring a fully equipped gym, the option to hire a personal trainer, a jet-powered exercise pool, sauna, and steam room. For added convenience, there's a commercial laundry facility equipped with washing machines and dryers.\r\n\r\nAdelaide Square is strategically positioned just a 5-minute stroll from St. Stephen's Green, Dublin's premier retail district, encompassing Grafton Street, Temple Bar, Trinity College, and the College of Surgeons. Its proximity to the Dublin financial, business, shopping, leisure, and entertainment centers makes it an ideal location. Adelaide Square's neighborhood is adorned with historic cathedrals, libraries, museums, and galleries. This enviable location offers the perfect blend of city-center living with artisan shops, restaurants, cafes, bars, and cultural attractions at your doorstep. Located in both Dublin 8 and Dublin 2 districts, the vibrant Camden Street, with its diverse eateries and bustling bars, is just a short walk away. Transportation is a breeze with excellent links nearby, including the QBC on Aungier Street and Dame Street, the LUAS Green line at Stephens Green for South Dublin and Cross City, and Pearse Street Dart station, all within easy reach. Adelaide Square even provides easy access to Dublin City Bikes.\r\n\r\nA viewing is essential to fully grasp the allure of this remarkable property. Don't miss this opportunity to experience the epitome of sophisticated city living at No. 163 Adelaide Square."
      },
